user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-19T08:59:13Z","updated_at":"2025-04-19T08:59:13Z","body":"My PR has been ready for a while, I'm updating it as needed until it is decided to merge it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816618477/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816651395","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100443#issuecomment-2816651395","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100443","id":2816651395,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n4rCD","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-19T10:34:55Z","updated_at":"2025-04-19T10:34:55Z","body":"I did some improvements in #105556 that doesn't mark `_get_noise_xd` as required and print an error when it's not available. Additionally, the parameter of the `_get_noise_xd` is not `VectorX` to be consistent with `get_noise_xd`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816651395/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816663038","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100443#issuecomment-2816663038","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100443","id":2816663038,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n4t3-","user":{"login":"Zylann","id":1311555,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTE1NTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1311555?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann","html_url":"https://github.com/Zylann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-19T11:15:01Z","updated_at":"2025-04-19T11:22:50Z","body":"> I did some improvements in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105556 that doesn't mark _get_noise_xd as required and print an error when it's not available.\r\n\r\nIsn't it already printing an error if you don't implement a virtual method? Why would it be needed to manually check this? \r\nIt should also be noted that code using `Noise` often expects it to work in each dimension. So if one decides to not implement a dimension, they can just return 0 instead of forgetting or receiving an error spam.\r\n\r\n> Additionally, the parameter of the _get_noise_xd is not VectorX to be consistent with get_noise_xd\r\n\r\nThat's one of the things I find quite pointless in the noise API, IMO it should have been a vector all along... but if it's really important I could change it to not use vector...\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816663038/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816667363","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100443#issuecomment-2816667363","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100443","id":2816667363,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n4u7j","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-19T11:29:24Z","updated_at":"2025-04-19T11:29:24Z","body":">Isn't it already printing an error if you don't implement a virtual method? Why would it be needed to manually check this?\r\n\r\nFor example, If _get_image is overridden but _get_noise_xd is not overridden, it should works in NoiseTexture2D and doesn't print errors.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816667363/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816668037","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100443#issuecomment-2816668037","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100443","id":2816668037,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n4vGF","user":{"login":"Zylann","id":1311555,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTE1NTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1311555?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann","html_url":"https://github.com/Zylann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-19T11:31:37Z","updated_at":"2025-04-19T11:47:58Z","body":"> For example, If _get_image is overridden but _get_noise_xd is not overridden, it should works in NoiseTexture2D and doesn't print errors.\r\n\r\nIn that case, if you override `_get_image` and implement only that, then calling `get_image` actually works though, since none of the non-implemented `get_noise` will be invoked.\r\n\r\nIt's quite weird to implement `_get_image` but not `get_noise` tho. Buf if for some reason your usage of `Noise` has to call `get_noise` yet you dont want to see errors despite the absence of implementation, you can always return 0.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816668037/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816677662","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100443#issuecomment-2816677662","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100443","id":2816677662,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n4xce","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-19T12:06:12Z","updated_at":"2025-04-19T12:06:12Z","body":"Closed https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105556. This PR works as expected.\r\n\r\nHowever, in godot regression test project this can't pass :\r\n```\r\nNoise.get_seamless_image --- executing with 6 parameters [100, 100, false, false, 100.0, false]\r\nGDSCRIPT CODE:     Noise.new().get_seamless_image(100, 100, false, false, 100.0, false)\r\n```\r\nbecause `p_blend_skirt=100.0` is too large and get stucked.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816677662/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816687948","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100443#issuecomment-2816687948","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100443","id":2816687948,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n4z9M","user":{"login":"Zylann","id":1311555,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTE1NTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1311555?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann","html_url":"https://github.com/Zylann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-19T12:25:12Z","updated_at":"2025-04-19T12:31:03Z","body":"> because p_blend_skirt=100.0 is too large and get stucked.\r\n\r\nIt is freezing? Was this an existing problem with the tests or something the PR introduced?\r\nI think if some code tries to instantiate a `Noise` where nothing is implemented, it will probably just error spam, which is unfortunately expected? I don't think p_blend_skirt is for anything in this, despite the incorrect value.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816687948/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816690739","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100443#issuecomment-2816690739","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100443","id":2816690739,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n40oz","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-19T12:34:39Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T04:44:14Z","body":"It will print _get_noise_2d is not implemented then try to generate 10100x10100x101 image.\r\nI don't think this is an issue with this PR. We should modify the regression test project instead. \r\n\r\nAlternatively, we can clamp blend skirt to not be larger than 1.0 (I'm not sure, but it seems a very large blend skirt is meaningless)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816690739/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946551327","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100443#issuecomment-2946551327","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100443","id":2946551327,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6voM4f","user":{"login":"Zylann","id":1311555,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTE1NTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1311555?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann","html_url":"https://github.com/Zylann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/us